dsh-ssh-vpn-bridge uses dsh-ssh-remote as a pinned runtime dependency and adapts the shape of its remote terminal session/backend API.

Upstream project: https://github.com/CrazyShout/dsh-ssh-remote
License: MIT
Copyright belongs to the respective upstream authors/contributors.

This repository's own additions include automatic direct-first GitHub reachability probing, Windows HTTP/mixed-proxy detection, SSH reverse-tunnel lifecycle management, remote proxy environment injection, and integration glue.
